WEBVTT

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:01.304
the world got bigger.

00:01:01.304 --> 00:01:04.289
NN: Thank you. (Applause)

00:01:04.289 --> 00:01:06.348
Thank you.

00:01:06.348 --> 00:01:08.456
When I was asked to do this,

00:01:08.456 --> 00:01:12.652
I was also asked to look at all 14 TED Talks

00:01:12.652 --> 00:01:14.362
that I had given,

00:01:14.362 --> 00:01:16.160
chronologically.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:18.434
The first one was actually two hours.

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:19.890
The second one was an hour,

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.439
and then they became half hours,

00:01:21.439 --> 00:01:25.375
and all I noticed was my bald spot getting bigger.

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:26.995
(Laughter)

00:01:26.995 --> 00:01:31.163
Imagine seeing your life, 30 years of it, go by,